title: Glass Case Puzzle
story: fever-dream
description: Tests breaking the glass case with and without the wrench

---

## Cannot break without wrench

$teleport Laboratory

> break glass case
[OK: contains "bare hands"]
[EVENT: false, type="story.event.glass-break"]

## Cannot break random objects

> break workbenches
[OK: contains "Violence"]
[EVENT: false, type="story.event.glass-break"]

## Break succeeds with wrench

$take pipe wrench

> break glass case with wrench
[OK: contains "brass key"]
[EVENT: true, type="story.event.glass-break"]

## Cannot break again

> break glass case with wrench
[OK: contains "already shattered"]
[EVENT: false, type="story.event.glass-break"]
